Compare the respondent's delegated authority with this agreement, phase, date and acceptance act. A coordinator who may receive documents is not automatically authorized to accept contractual performance. Preserve conflicting authority records and request a named confirmation. Return missing or contradicted prerequisites; an empty list means the supplied records establish authority for the exact acceptance.
